{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大标题首先入眼，紫色强调的“不再需要他陪”“不自在了呢”最醒目；随后中部灰白大句和下方黄色强调句也争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他开始担心对方有一天不再需要自己陪伴，甚至不愿意和自己待在一起。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、担忧、不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他此刻已经安静下来，刚才还敢往远处期待，现在却不敢继续想；同时想起两人目前仍然亲近，这些是真实的，因此又有一点高兴。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三块字号接近、都有醒目强调色的大句争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在标题、中部句和下方句里，要拼起来才能理解担忧、安静下来和重新获得一点高兴之间的关系。\",\n    \"单块长句包含多层意思和转折，不能只靠放大的关键词完整理解。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aa59835c-dabb-4752-95a0-fd10304682e6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T010952300619Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:10:29.511103+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "89d837ce825bdafb6c10ccf679c9feb7af51a188d78a39fba8c2928adb7ab11a", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool